## **41. Complete Network Communication Flow**

Consider what happens when you open:

```
https://example.com/users
```

A simplified communication flow:

**Browser / Client**

Wants to retrieve /users

**DNS**

Resolves example.com to an IP address

**Transport**

TCP connection for HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2; QUIC over UDP for HTTP/3

**HTTP Protocol**

Formats the GET request, headers and other message information

**IP + Data Link**

Routes packets and delivers frames to the next hop

**Web Server**

Parses request and executes business logic

Response

